# CH reviewed code release: keep scientific outputs and private staging out of Git.
# These rules do not remove already-tracked files.
/publication/release_staging/
/publication/submission/
/publication/audits/
/publication/development_archive/
/publication/validation/github_selection_review/
/publication/validation/github_staging/
**/publication/development_archive/
**/publication/intermediate/
**/publication/source_data/
**/publication/validation/.*/
**/publication/production_run/
**/publication/production_clean/
/*.zip
/*.tar.gz

# Lean release: generated reports stay local. Reviewed seed inputs are added explicitly.
**/publication/validation/*
/publication/validation/github_staging_lean/

